# Build logs. No such file is committed any more — the 143 KB UTF-16 log of the
# zhipuai/crewai pyjwt conflict was deleted once the conflict was fixed — but the
# pattern stays: `docker compose build 2>&1 | tee <log>` is exactly how that one
# got committed, and a captured build log never belongs in an image layer.
docker-build-error.txt
*-build-error.txt
build-*.log
